/-!
# Regular embeddings are cut out by regular sequences (route F14)

Local algebra input for the `QuasiregularCover` of a regular closed subscheme of a regular scheme.

* `exists_subfinset_span_eq_spanFinrank`: a finite generating set of the maximal ideal of a local
  Noetherian ring contains a subfamily of cardinality `spanFinrank m` generating `m`.
* `exists_isWeaklyRegular_list_of_quotient_regular`: if `A` and `A/I` are regular local, then `I`
  is generated by a weakly regular list of length `dim A - dim A/I`.
-/


